WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000
Go back quickly

2
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,000
You don't want me to come back alive

3
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:07,900
Is it that serious? Is there a mission?

4
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:11,460
Pinch my daughter’s face

5
00:00:11,460 --> 00:00:12,660
Dad is out for two days

6
00:00:12,660 --> 00:00:22,540
Just listen to Uncle Dashan and it'll be fine

7
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:24,540
Your father will be back in two days

8
00:00:24,540 --> 00:00:25,540
Uncle Dashan

9
00:00:25,540 --> 00:00:27,540
Dad is not here

10
00:00:27,540 --> 00:00:29,540
So I don’t want to eat anything

11
00:00:29,540 --> 00:00:31,660
You can eat whatever you want

12
00:00:31,660 --> 00:00:41,340
Probably so

13
00:00:41,340 --> 00:00:42,340
little ancestor
